    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nA bright and modern second-floor apartment extending to approximately 57 sq m, complete with secure underground parking and 24-hour security.\n\nSavills is delighted to present 11 Baltrasna House, a beautifully presented second-floor apartment situated within the landmark Spencer Dock development, one of Dublin's most established and sought-after residential addresses. Extending to approximately 57 sq m / 614 sq ft, this impressive property combines generous living accommodation with the convenience of secure parking and an unrivalled city centre location.\n\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a inviting entrance hall leading to a well-designed living space that maximises both comfort and functionality. The open-plan living and dining area provides an ideal setting for both relaxing and entertaining, while the open plan kitchen is fitted with a range of modern units and integrated appliances. Large floor to ceiling windows allow an abundance of natural light to flow throughout the apartment, creating a bright and airy atmosphere.\n\nThe accommodation is completed by a spacious double bedroom with fitted wardrobes and a well-appointed bathroom finished to a high standard. The apartment has been carefully maintained and offers a superb opportunity for owner-occupiers and investors alike seeking a high-quality home in the heart of the city.\n\nFurther enhancing its appeal is the inclusion of one secure underground car parking space, a highly valuable feature in such a central location. Residents also benefit from 24-hour security, professionally landscaped communal areas and excellent on-site concierge.\n\nSpencer Dock occupies a prime waterfront setting in Dublin's thriving Docklands district, placing a wealth of amenities within easy reach. The IFSC, Convention Centre Dublin, Three Arena and a host of cafés, restaurants and retail offerings are all nearby. Excellent transport connections, including the Luas Red Line, DART and Connolly Station, ensure convenient access to all parts of the city and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Second-floor apartment.</li><li>Bright and spacious accommodation with a modern open-plan layout.</li><li>Generous double bedroom with fitted wardrobes.</li><li>One secure underground car parking space included.</li><li>Benefit of 24-hour on-site security within a professionally managed development.</li><li>Prime Docklands location adjacent to the IFSC, Spencer Dock Luas Stop and Connolly Station.</ul>"
      },
